We reached my apartment building.
Rohan, Priya, and I went inside the building.
There, my neighbour Asha is standing.
Her dog Moti is also with her.
"Maya!"
"I have waited for you," Asha says with a smile.
"Happy birthday!" she says warmly.
"Thank you, Asha," I say.
Asha takes out a small box from her bag.
"I bought this for you today," she says.
"Inside, there are special local sweets."
"I have brought your favourite sweets," she adds.
I take the box and feel very happy.
I pet the dog Moti affectionately and say, "How are you, Moti?"
"Asha, please come inside with us," I invite her.
"We are celebrating together," Priya says.
"Rohan brought a cake too," I say.
"Did you make chai?" Asha asks me.
"Not yet, I will make it now," I reply.
Asha smiles and agrees to come with us.
